@startuml
actor "Student" as Student
participant "Student App" as StudentApp
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Trip & Route Service" as TripSvc
participant "WebSocket Hub" as WS
database "DB" as DB
participant "GPS Realtime Service" as GPSSvc

Student -> StudentApp : open app
StudentApp -> API : GET /routes, /stops, /trips
ref over Student, StudentApp, API, Auth
    UC-16 Authorization Flow
end ref
API -> TripSvc : fetch planned trips & stops
TripSvc -> DB : query routes/stops/trips
DB --> TripSvc : data
TripSvc --> API : data
API --> StudentApp : render map & schedule

== Subscribe realtime (include UC-18) ==
StudentApp -> WS : CONNECT /ws?tripId=...
WS --> StudentApp : ACK
GPSSvc -> WS : broadcast gps(tripId,lat,lon)
WS --> StudentApp : update marker
@enduml